<title>USA: Glacier to buy assets of McKesson unit.</title>
<headline>Glacier to buy assets of McKesson unit.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glacier Water Services Inc said it agreed in principle with McKesson Water Products Co, a unit of McKesson Corp, for the acquisition of the assets of its Aqua-Vend Division.</p>
<p>The transaction is scheduled to close by March 31 and no details were disclosed.</p>
